          %h2#references References
          %p The notion of Minkowski spacetime originates with
          %ul
            %li#Minkowski07
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hermann+Minkowski"}> Hermann Minkowski
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Die Grundgleichungen für die elektromagnetischen Vorgänge in bewegten Körpern
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/BF01455871"} doi:10.1007/BF01455871
          %blockquote
            %p#TheViewsOfSpaceAndTime The views of space and time that I wish to lay before you have sprung from the soil of experimental physics, and therein lies their strength. They are radical. Henceforth space by itself, and time by itself, are doomed to fade away into mere shadows, and only a kind of union of both will retain an independent reality.
            %p
              (Address to the 80th Assembly of German Natural Scientists and Physicians, (Sep 21, 1908), see
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://en.wikiquote.org/wiki/Hermann_Minkowski"} WikiQuote
          %p On the early history of the idea:
          %ul
            %li
              Galina Weinstein:
              %em Max Born, Albert Einstein and Hermann Minkowski’s Space-Time Formalism of Special Relativity
              \&amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1210.6929"}> arXiv:1210.6929
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p See also:
          %ul
            %li
              Wikipedia,
              %em
                %a{:href => "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Minkowski_space"} Minkowski space
          %p
            With attention to the
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/conformal+boundary"} conformal boundary
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Juan+A.+Valiente+Kroon"}> Juan A. Valiente Kroon
              \: Chapter 16 of:
              = succeed "," do
                %em Conformal Methods in General Relativity
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1017/9781009291309"} doi:10.1017/9781009291309
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://library.oapen.org/handle/20.500.12657/59217"} oapen:20.500.12657/59217
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://library.oapen.org/bitstream/id/548cfabe-a25b-4562-b95e-aa2894525f32/9781009291309.pdf"} pdf
          %p Gravitational stability of Minkowski spacetime:
          %ul
